tag=$OKTA_USERS json id status passwordChanged
| last id
| time passwordChanged pcTS
| eval
    n = 0;
    if (status == "ACTIVE") {
        if (!has(pcTS)) { n = 1; }
        else if ((unix(NOW) - unix(pcTS)) / 86400 > 90) { n = 1; }
    }
| stats sum(n) as count
| alias count " "
| numbercard " "
